sequenceDiagram
    participant U as ""用户
    participant A as ""ReActAgent
    participant L as ""DeepSeek
    participant T as ""工具

    U->>A: run("100*2 等于多少？")
    Note over A: 第 1 轮迭代
    A->>L: Prompt(ReAct指令 + 历史空 + 问题)
